@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
[*] --> OPEN : 创建 [已确认异常且指派人有效]
OPEN --> IN_PROGRESS : START [当前有效指派人]
IN_PROGRESS --> IN_PROGRESS : PROGRESS
IN_PROGRESS --> AWAITING_ACCEPTANCE : SUBMIT [过程与结果完整]
AWAITING_ACCEPTANCE --> IN_PROGRESS : REJECT_ACCEPTANCE [复测不通过]
AWAITING_ACCEPTANCE --> CLOSED : ACCEPT [独立且真实复测通过]
note right of IN_PROGRESS : REASSIGN状态不变，历史执行人仍回避
note right of CLOSED : 工单关闭不保证其他资源限制已解除
@enduml
